{"data":{"body":"**P1 \u2014 Recheck scope fatals after end-hook dispatch.** A scope can report `VirtualMachineError` or `ThreadDeath` while a blocking `onInvocationEnd` hook runs. Since the only check occurs before dispatch, `execute()` can still return PENDING or propagate the original retry despite observing the fatal before responding. Re-run `throwIfScopeFatal(scopeFatal)` after this dispatch, without firing hooks again, and require the late-dispatch test to propagate the original fatal to the caller.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc77AdPl","finding_digest":"d43371534e39ba8ef3db8885e66b122c9182a4cc77f87519192245519be87d31","finding_id":"arf_v1_2qzxcu2ohg5i5463rcc6m2ysfs","finding_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::awaithandlerscopes::fatal-cleanup-propagation","identity_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::awaithandlerscopes::fatal-cleanup-propagation","line":453,"observation_digest":"6f917acff5c3791b802d6f02832ed48fa6656ab4e5ccc8893be391410078272c","observation_id":"aro_v1_n6ixvt7vyn4rxabnn4biglwur6","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/execution/DurableExecutor.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_2qzxcu2ohg5i5463rcc6m2ysfs","published_at":"2026-10-07T19:41:28Z","review_id":"arr_v1_ajkzfh6go2oyifyox4jonbw7kj","reviewed_base_sha":"95a63f3a9db5d327620d76fb95b8372f53db6eaa","reviewed_head_sha":"6691a55f2e66a7076e97f0424e7579c6b7811696","reviewer":"codex","start_line":453,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":769},"record_id":"art_v1_nasxqia22euqldvwevnjufquzw","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-07T19:41:28Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
